@startuml C3_VVE_Update_Physical_View
title C3 – VVE Update (Physical / Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
}

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

node "User Device" as Device {
  artifact "Angular SPA" as Spa
}

node "PLMS Backend" as Backend {
  artifact ".NET TodoApi" as TodoApi
}

node "OEM Platform" as Platform {
  artifact "OEM API Pod" as OemApi
  artifact "Command Worker" as CommandWorker
  database "VVE Database" as VveDb
  database "VVN Database" as VvnDb
  database "Audit Log Store" as AuditDb
}

node "IAM Cluster" as Identity {
  artifact "OIDC Provider" as Idp
}

node "Event Bus" as Bus {
  artifact "Audit Topic" as AuditTopic
}

Operator --> Spa : HTTPS
Spa --> TodoApi : REST (PATCH VVE)
TodoApi --> OemApi : HTTPS
OemApi --> CommandWorker : Dispatch update command
CommandWorker --> VveDb : Update VVE record
CommandWorker --> VvnDb : Read planned dock
CommandWorker --> AuditDb : Append log entry
CommandWorker --> AuditTopic : Publish VVE_UPDATED
OemApi --> TodoApi : Updated VVE DTO
TodoApi --> Spa : JSON response
TodoApi --> Idp : Token introspection (per session)
Spa --> Idp : Login/OAuth flow

@enduml
